    "title": "Preterite Tense: Irregular Verbs",
    "subtitle": "Irregular stems (u, i, j), ser and ir, and verbs that change meaning in the preterite",
    "footer": "Spanish Learning Program · A2 · Verbs · Preterite (irregular)",
